  "integration": {
    "summary": "Enable the DCM014A51 option on the iTM, assign each indoor unit a unique device ID and a BACnet network number for the virtual network, then use Occupancy Mode and the setpoint objects per indoor unit device. System-wide schedule, auto-changeover and forced-off objects sit on the separate system control device.",
